---
import { doctorProfile, navItems } from '../data/site';
---

<footer id="contacto" class="bg-[#061526] py-16 pb-7 text-white">
  <div class="container-premium">
    <div class="grid gap-8 border-b border-white/12 pb-9 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-[1.25fr_0.75fr_0.75fr]">
      <div>
        <a href="#inicio" class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3.5">
          <span class="grid h-12 w-12 place-items-center rounded-[18px] bg-gradient-to-br from-navy to-teal font-black text-white ring-1 ring-champagne/35 ring-inset">{doctorProfile.monogram}</span>
          <span class="text-lg font-black tracking-[-0.02em]">{doctorProfile.fullName}<small class="block text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-white/48">{doctorProfile.specialty}</small></span>
        </a>
        <p class="max-w-md text-white/62">
          Consulta privada de psiquiatria en San Angel, Ciudad de Mexico. Atencion personalizada, confidencial y basada en evidencia.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4 class="mb-3 font-black">Navegacion</h4>
        {navItems.slice(1, 5).map((item) => <a class="my-2 block text-white/62 hover:text-white" href={item.href}>{item.label}</a>)}
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4 class="mb-3 font-black">Contacto</h4>
        <a class="my-2 block text-white/62 hover:text-white" href={doctorProfile.doctoraliaUrl}>Doctoralia</a>
        <a class="my-2 block text-white/62 hover:text-white" href={doctorProfile.phoneHref}>{doctorProfile.phoneLabel}</a>
        <a class="my-2 block text-white/62 hover:text-white" href={doctorProfile.secondaryPhoneHref}>{doctorProfile.secondaryPhoneLabel}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="pt-5 text-xs text-white/42">
      Informacion general. No sustituye una valoracion medica. En caso de emergencia, acude a servicios de urgencias.
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
